<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13019] Unexpected JOIN result when querying a single-node cluster</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13019</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Check reproducer near,&lt;br/&gt;
seems something wrong with pkey logic , if we change it - results will be ok. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
    @Test
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; void test() &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;throws&lt;/span&gt; Exception {
        inlineSize = 10;

        startGrid(0);

        &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; t1 = &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;CREATE TABLE dept\n&quot;&lt;/span&gt; +
            &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot; (\n&quot;&lt;/span&gt; +
