                            <comment id="17397989" author="amashenkov" created="Thu, 12 Aug 2021 10:57:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=timonin.maksim&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;timonin.maksim&quot;&gt;timonin.maksim&lt;/a&gt;, PR looks good, except the one thing: class name QueryPartitionsChecker is irrelevant.&lt;br/&gt;
